flowchart TD
    SEND[Channel send attempt] -->|success| DELIVERED[channel: DELIVERED]
    SEND -->|failure| RETRYING[channel: RETRYING]

    RETRYING --> ENQUEUE[Enqueue to SQS Retry Queue]
    ENQUEUE --> WORKER[retry-worker-lambda]

    WORKER -->|retryCount <= MAX_RETRIES| REPUBLISH[Republish NotificationRequested to EventBridge]
    REPUBLISH --> SEND

    WORKER -->|retryCount > MAX_RETRIES business limit| FAILED[channel: FAILED — no message loss]

    ENQUEUE -.->|Lambda invocation itself fails
    SQS redrive: maxReceiveCount| DLQ[SQS retry-dlq]
    DLQ -.-> ALARM[CloudWatch Alarm]
    ALARM -.-> SNS[SNS alerts topic]

    classDef business fill:#2E7D32,color:#fff,stroke:none
    classDef infra fill:#C0392B,color:#fff,stroke:none
    class RETRYING,WORKER,REPUBLISH,FAILED,DELIVERED business
    class DLQ,ALARM,SNS infra
